-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ב/14: הקצאה חליפית למענקים בשנת הלימודים תשע"ב (12.8.2012)
-- The one-time grant in place of grants for school year 2011/12, under
-- section 37 of the general agreement of 14.8.2011, to the teaching staff of
-- the owners' upper divisions: 2,000 ₪ for a full position, pro-rated by
-- position and by the period employed (9/2011-6/2012), what it is excluded
-- from, the pension contributions on it, payment in August 2012 and the
-- Ministry's reimbursement.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשע"ב/14 הקצאה חליפית למענקים בשנת הלימודים תשע"ב`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, title, date (12.8.2012), reference number, addressee, subject line, and the lead-in: the general agreement of 14.8.2011 on Oz LaTmura and all upper-division staff, and this circular's purpose under its section 37; no rule of its own.

-- Time is counted in school months of 2011/12 (common.l4: September 2011 =
-- 1, June 2012 = 10, August 2012 = 12); September 2012 is 13.

@desc A teaching employee's school year 2011/12 in an owner's upper division, as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `grant year` HAS
    `in the upper-division teaching-staff grade` IS A BOOLEAN @desc in the teaching-staff grade in the upper division
    `employed by an owner supervised by the Ministry` IS A BOOLEAN @desc an owner of secondary education supervised by the Ministry of Education
    `employed in the upper division in 2011/12` IS A BOOLEAN
    `upper-division position`            IS A NUMBER @desc the share of a full position held in the upper division (1 = 100%); the grant goes by the upper-division position only
    `months employed from 9/2011 to 6/2012` IS A NUMBER @desc months of the ten from September 2011 to June 2012 in which the employee was employed, not counting unpaid leave or a sabbatical
    `months of statutory maternity leave` IS A NUMBER @desc months of the same ten on maternity leave under the Employment of Women Law, 1954 — not unpaid leave, or an absence treated as unpaid leave, after it ends

DECLARE `grant action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the grant` HAS `grant paid` IS A NUMBER
    `reimburse the owner for the grant`

§§ `1 תחולה`

@ref akn:art_1
GIVEN g IS A `grant year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `this circular applies to` g IF
        g's `in the upper-division teaching-staff grade`
    AND g's `employed by an owner supervised by the Ministry`

§§ `2 הקצאה חליפית למענקים בשנת הלימודים תשע"ב`

-- 2(א): a teaching employee employed in 2011/12 in the upper division is
-- entitled to a one-time grant of 2,000 ₪ for a full position. The
-- arrangement covers every upper division, whether or not it joined Oz
-- LaTmura (¶3), so joining is not an input.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a akn:art_2__para_a/p3
GIVEN g IS A `grant year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the grant for a full position for` g IS
    IF `entitled to the grant` g
    THEN `the grant for a full position`
    ELSE 0

`the grant for a full position` MEANS 2000

GIVEN g IS A `grant year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the grant` g IF
        `this circular applies to` g
    AND g's `employed in the upper division in 2011/12`

-- 2(א) ¶2: a part position, or part of the year — unpaid leave and a
-- sabbatical included — takes the proportional part, by the position and by
-- the period employed out of the school year 9/2011-6/2012, and by the
-- upper-division position only. Statutory maternity leave is not deducted;
-- unpaid leave after it is.
-- F-2011-12_tashab_14-a: "2,000 ₪ for a full position" pro-rates a part
-- position down and says nothing of a position above 100%. The reading
-- adopted: 2,000 ₪ is a rate per full position, so the upper-division
-- position is applied as it is, above 100% too.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a/p2
@export default The one-time grant for school year 2011/12 an owner pays an upper-division teaching employee with the August 2012 salary under circular תשע"ב/14
GIVEN g IS A `grant year` @desc the employee's school year in the upper division
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the grant` g IS
    `the grant for a full position for` g
    TIMES `the position share` g
    TIMES `the period share` g

`months of the year the grant counts` MEANS 10

GIVEN g IS A `grant year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the period share` g IS
    min ((g's `months employed from 9/2011 to 6/2012` PLUS g's `months of statutory maternity leave`)
         DIVIDED BY `months of the year the grant counts`)
        1

GIVEN g IS A `grant year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position share` g IS
    g's `upper-division position`

-- The other reading of F-2011-12_tashab_14-a: the grant is at most the
-- amount for one full position.
GIVEN g IS A `grant year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the grant capped at one position` g IS
    `the grant for a full position for` g
    TIMES min (`the position share` g) 1
    TIMES `the period share` g

-- 2(ב): the grant is not part of the base of the hourly value, severance
-- pay or percentage additions, and no study-fund contributions are made on
-- it.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b
GIVEN b IS A `salary base`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the grant is excluded from` b IF
    CONSIDER b
    WHEN `the base of the hourly value` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the base of severance pay` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the base of percentage additions` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the base of study-fund contributions` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

@desc What a salary payment may be part of, as section 2(ב) lists it.
DECLARE `salary base` IS ONE OF
    `the base of the hourly value`
    `the base of severance pay`
    `the base of percentage additions`
    `the base of study-fund contributions`
    `any other base`

-- 2(ג): pension-fund contributions on the grant: 5% from the employer for
-- benefits, and 5% deducted from the teacher's salary for benefits.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c
GIVEN g IS A `grant year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the employer's pension contribution on the grant` g IS
    `the grant` g TIMES `the employer's pension contribution rate`

`the employer's pension contribution rate` MEANS 5%
`the teacher's pension deduction rate` MEANS 5%

GIVEN g IS A `grant year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the teacher's pension deduction on the grant` g IS
    `the grant` g TIMES `the teacher's pension deduction rate`

§§ `3 תשלום`

-- Section 3: the grant is paid with the August 2012 salary; section 4: the
-- Ministry's reimbursement reaches the owners with the tuition payment for
-- 8/2012, paid at the start of 9/2012.
@ref akn:art_3
GIVEN g IS A `grant year`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `grant action`
DECIDE `paying the grant with August's salary` g IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the grant` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the grant` g
    WITHIN `month number` August
    HENCE `the Ministry's reimbursement of the grant`
    LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "section 3: the grant is paid with the August 2012 salary"

@ref akn:art_4
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `grant action`
DECIDE `the Ministry's reimbursement of the grant` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owner for the grant`
    WITHIN 1
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "section 4: the reimbursement comes with the tuition payment for 8/2012, paid at the start of 9/2012"

-- akn:art_5 The contact line for questions; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and signature; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

`a full-position teacher all year` MEANS
    `grant year` WITH
        `in the upper-division teaching-staff grade` IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner supervised by the Ministry` IS TRUE
        `employed in the upper division in 2011/12` IS TRUE
        `upper-division position`            IS 1
        `months employed from 9/2011 to 6/2012` IS 10
        `months of statutory maternity leave` IS 0

#ASSERT `the grant` `a full-position teacher all year` EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `the employer's pension contribution on the grant` `a full-position teacher all year` EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `the teacher's pension deduction on the grant` `a full-position teacher all year` EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `the grant is excluded from` `the base of the hourly value`
#ASSERT `the grant is excluded from` `the base of study-fund contributions`

-- Half a position, six months worked and three of statutory maternity
-- leave: 2,000 × 0.5 × 9/10.
`a half-position teacher with maternity leave` MEANS
    `grant year` WITH
        `in the upper-division teaching-staff grade` IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner supervised by the Ministry` IS TRUE
        `employed in the upper division in 2011/12` IS TRUE
        `upper-division position`            IS 0.5
        `months employed from 9/2011 to 6/2012` IS 6
        `months of statutory maternity leave` IS 3

#ASSERT `the grant` `a half-position teacher with maternity leave` EQUALS 900

-- F-2011-12_tashab_14-a: at 1.3 of a position all year, the two readings
-- give 2,600 ₪ and 2,000 ₪.
`a teacher at 130% all year` MEANS
    `grant year` WITH
        `in the upper-division teaching-staff grade` IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner supervised by the Ministry` IS TRUE
        `employed in the upper division in 2011/12` IS TRUE
        `upper-division position`            IS 1.3
        `months employed from 9/2011 to 6/2012` IS 10
        `months of statutory maternity leave` IS 0

`the grant above a full position is read two ways` MEANS
    NOT (`the grant` `a teacher at 130% all year`
         EQUALS `the grant capped at one position` `a teacher at 130% all year`)
#ASSERT `the grant above a full position is read two ways`
#ASSERT `the grant` `a teacher at 130% all year` EQUALS 2600

#TRACE `paying the grant with August's salary` `a full-position teacher all year` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the grant` 2000 AT 12
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education` DOES `reimburse the owner for the grant` AT 13
#TRACE `paying the grant with August's salary` `a full-position teacher all year` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the grant` 1000 AT 12
